+/*
+ * mt7921_mac_init() turns this on, as a chip that takes unified commands does
+ * this station by station, once mac80211 is ready for such frames. There is no
+ * telling this firmware that, and mac80211 drops them before the station is
+ * authorized. That would be the frames of the key handshake.
